          {
            "kind": "context",
            "start": 13,
            "end": 811,
            "text": "I’m Saksham, an AI automation and technology advisor. I build AI agents on WhatsApp, web and email on my own production n8n stack, along with the integrations and architecture around them, and I handle scoping, delivery and support end to end. I’m looking for partners who already talk to business owners and can introduce me to the right ones: companies with a real operational problem (support overload, manual follow-ups, leads slipping through, data copied between tools) and a decision-maker open to a conversation. It’s a revenue share on every client you bring in, and we agree the details together. No retainers, no pay-per-lead, warm introductions only. If this fits how you work, reply here or message me with where your introductions would come from and the kinds of businesses you know.",
            "sha256": "7ae07d5dc63eced2c2ef4badd97a6c0613e9fe1be650f0191870892ecbad99ca"
          },
          {
            "kind": "context",
            "start": 820,
            "end": 925,
            "text": "Replies are closed - contact the author using email, application form or direct message. Read more here .",
