        "spans": [
          {
            "kind": "context",
            "start": 13,
            "end": 1012,
            "text": "I built a ready-to-import n8n workflow for VCs, angel investors, and B2B growth teams that monitors a shortlist of company domains and alerts you only when a company shows simultaneous operational breakout signals: What it tracks in parallel: Hiring Velocity (Live ATS Boards): Checks open roles directly from Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby, and Workable to detect sudden surges in engineering, AI, or sales hiring (a direct operational signal of fresh capital or scaling). Active Google Ads Spend: Pulls active creatives and campaign longevity from the Google Ads Transparency Center to verify paid customer acquisition spend. Tech Stack & Infrastructure: Detects pixel infrastructure (PostHog, Segment, Stripe) and extracts published company contact endpoints. Breakout Scoring: Synthesizes the signals into an actionable 0–100 score so you only get pinged when a company is hitting an inflection point. How the workflow works: Step 1: Trigger with a list of domains (from a Google Sheet, CRM, or cron).",
            "sha256": "176760dbde55437befeba4a893747db005796a2f01b16bc523c508141ff44470"
          },
          {
            "kind": "context",
            "start": 1103,
            "end": 1165,
            "text": "Step 3: Filters companies where breakout_summary.score >= 60 .",
            "sha256": "ad2177202458664bd43c901b35d53b3ba6f550aee99a54da87235fb3856694c5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "context",
            "start": 1671,
            "end": 1765,
            "text": "Includes 5 free daily calls per IP so you can test end-to-end without signing up for anything.",
            "sha256": "02d2210b11d292b6b62825f20d90a56d5befe7e8c5fd2149666a38679d1ae63a"
          }
